    let res;try{res=retryInternal_(function(){return saveTransaction(payload);},1);}catch(e){res={success:false,message:String(e)};}clearTxCache_(chatId);if(res&&res.success){const oldMsg=s.last_msg_id,last=payload;let text;if(payload.jenis==='Pemindahan Saldo')text='<b>✅ PEMINDAHAN SALDO BERHASIL!</b>\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📅 '+esc_(payload.tanggal)+'\n👤 '+esc_(payload.kategoriPerson)+' ('+esc_(payload.sumberDana)+') ➡️ '+esc_(payload.sumberLayanan||payload.kategoriPerson)+' ('+esc_(payload.tujuanDana)+')\n💰 <b>'+rupiah_(payload.nominal)+'</b>\n✏️ '+esc_(payload.keterangan)+'\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nSaldo kedua dompet & person telah disesuaikan. ✨';else{text='<b>'+(payload.jenis==='Pengeluaran'?'🔴':'🟢')+' TRANSAKSI BERHASIL DISIMPAN!</b>\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📅 '+esc_(payload.tanggal)+'  |  👤 '+esc_(payload.kategoriPerson)+'\n📁 '+esc_(payload.kategoriPilihan)+'  |  💳 '+esc_(payload.jenisSaldo)+'\n💰 <b>'+rupiah_(payload.nominal)+'</b>\n✏️ '+esc_(payload.keterangan)+'\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nData langsung tersimpan di Google Sheets. 🚀';}const ns={step:'MENU',last_msg_id:oldMsg,last_payload:last,last_transaction_id:String(res.id||''),last_transaction_at:Date.now(),_updatedAt:Date.now()};saveSession_(chatId,ns);sendOrEdit_(chatId,text,[[btn_('↩️ Batalkan (1 menit)','undo_last_tx')],[btn_('➕ Catat Lagi','wizard_start'),btn_('🔁 Ulangi Ini','wizard_repeat_last')],[btn_('📊 Hari Ini','btn_today_summary'),btn_('💰 Cek Saldo','btn_cek_saldo')],[btn_('◀️ Menu Utama','btn_menu')]]);}else{s.step='CONFIRMATION';saveSession_(chatId,s);sendOrEdit_(chatId,'<b>❌ GAGAL MENYIMPAN TRANSAKSI</b>\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nAlasan: <i>'+esc_(res&&res.message||'Koneksi gagal')+'</i>\n\nData dipertahankan — tekan <b>Coba Lagi</b>.',[[btn_('🔄 Coba Lagi','do_save_transaction')],[btn_('◀️ Menu Utama','btn_menu')]]);}}

  function handleCommand_(chatId,messageId,text){
    try{
      const cmd=String(text||'').split(/\s+/)[0].toLowerCase().split('@')[0];
      if(cmd==='/total'){const p=getMappedPerson_(chatId)||'all';showBalance_(chatId,p);return;}
      const s=getSession_(chatId);s.step='MENU';saveSession_(chatId,s);sendOrEdit_(chatId,menuText_(),mainMenu_());
    }finally{deleteMessage_(chatId,messageId);}
  }
  function handleText_(chatId,messageId,userText){const s=getSession_(chatId),step=s.step;try{
    if(step==='WAIT_SEARCH_KEYWORD'){s.step=null;saveSession_(chatId,s);executeFilter_(chatId,'keyword',userText,1);return;}
    if(step==='WAIT_NATURAL_SEARCH'){s.step='MENU';saveSession_(chatId,s);executeNaturalSearch_(chatId,userText,1);return;}
    if(step==='WAIT_EXPORT_DATERANGE'){const ps=String(userText).toLowerCase().replace(/s\/d|sampai|to/g,'-').split('-').map(x=>x.trim()).filter(Boolean),a=ps[0]&&parseDate_(ps[0]),b=ps[1]&&parseDate_(ps[1]);if(!a||!b){sendOrEdit_(chatId,'❌ Rentang tanggal tidak valid. Gunakan <code>dd/mm/yyyy - dd/mm/yyyy</code>',[[btn_('◀️ Batal','btn_export')]]);return;}const start=a<=b?a:b,end=a<=b?b:a;s.step='MENU';saveSession_(chatId,s);showExportFormat_(chatId,{type:'range',start:fmtDate_(start),end:fmtDate_(end)},fmtDate_(start)+' s/d '+fmtDate_(end));return;}
    if(step==='WAIT_FILTER_DATE'){s.step=null;saveSession_(chatId,s);executeFilter_(chatId,'custom_date',userText,1);return;}
    if(step==='WAIT_FILTER_DATERANGE'){s.step=null;saveSession_(chatId,s);executeFilter_(chatId,'date_range',userText,1);return;}
    if(step==='WAIT_TEXT_PERSON'){s.person=userText;s.step='SELECT_TYPE';saveSession_(chatId,s);sendOrEdit_(chatId,'<b>📝 TRANSAKSI BARU (2/6)</b>\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n👤 Person : <b>'+esc_(userText)+'</b>\n\nPilih <b>Jenis Transaksi</b>:',typeMenu_(false));return;}
    if(step==='WAIT_TEXT_CATEGORY'){s.kategori=userText;s.step='SELECT_SALDO';saveSession_(chatId,s);sendOrEdit_(chatId,'<b>📝 TRANSAKSI BARU (4/6)</b>\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n👤 Person   : <b>'+esc_(s.person)+'</b>\n🏷️ Jenis    : <b>'+esc_(s.jenis)+'</b>\n📁 Kategori : <b>'+esc_(userText)+'</b> <i>(Custom)</i>\n\nPilih <b>Dompet / Saldo</b>:',walletMenu_());return;}
    if(step==='WAIT_TEXT_NOMINAL'){const n=Number(String(userText).replace(/\D/g,''));if(!(n>0)){sendOrEdit_(chatId,'❌ <b>Nominal tidak valid.</b>\nMasukkan angka saja, contoh: <code>50000</code>',[[btn_('◀️ Batal','back_quick_nom')]]);return;}s.nominal=n;s.step='WAIT_TEXT_KETERANGAN';saveSession_(chatId,s);sendOrEdit_(chatId,'<b>📝 TRANSAKSI BARU (6/6)</b>\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n👤 Person   : <b>'+esc_(s.person)+'</b>\n🏷️ Jenis    : <b>'+esc_(s.jenis)+'</b>\n📁 Kategori : <b>'+esc_(s.kategori)+'</b>\n💳 Dompet   : <b>'+esc_(s.saldo)+'</b>\n💰 Nominal  : <b>'+rupiah_(n)+'</b>\n\n✏️ <b>Ketik Keterangan Transaksi:</b>',keteranganMenu_());return;}
    if(step==='WAIT_TEXT_KETERANGAN'){s.keterangan=userText;s.step='CONFIRMATION';saveSession_(chatId,s);sendOrEdit_(chatId,confirmationText_(s),confirmMenu_());return;}
    if(step==='WAIT_TEXT_EDIT_NOMINAL'){const n=Number(String(userText).replace(/\D/g,''));if(!(n>0)){sendOrEdit_(chatId,'❌ Nominal tidak valid. Ketik angka nominal saja:',[[btn_('◀️ Batal','edit_back_to_summary')]]);return;}if(s.editing_tx)s.editing_tx.nominal=n;s.step=null;saveSession_(chatId,s);sendOrEdit_(chatId,editSummary_(s.editing_tx||{}),editMenu_());return;}
    if(step==='WAIT_TEXT_EDIT_KET'){if(s.editing_tx)s.editing_tx.keterangan=userText;s.step=null;saveSession_(chatId,s);sendOrEdit_(chatId,editSummary_(s.editing_tx||{}),editMenu_());return;}
    if(step==='WAIT_TEXT_EDIT_CAT'){if(s.editing_tx)s.editing_tx.kategoriPilihan=userText;s.step=null;saveSession_(chatId,s);sendOrEdit_(chatId,editSummary_(s.editing_tx||{}),editMenu_());return;}
    s.step='MENU';saveSession_(chatId,s);executeNaturalSearch_(chatId,userText,1);
  }catch(e){console.error('[LAVI TG text] '+e.stack);resetSession_(chatId,true);sendOrEdit_(chatId,menuText_(),mainMenu_());}finally{deleteMessage_(chatId,messageId);}}

  function handleCallback_(chatId,cbId,data,msgId){if(!isAllowed_(chatId)){answerCb_(cbId,'❌ Akses tidak diizinkan.',true);return;}const ownAck=(data==='do_save_transaction'||data==='confirm_sensitive_save'||data==='undo_last_tx'||data==='confirm_undo_last_tx'||data==='do_save_edited_tx'||data==='confirm_save_edited_tx'||data.indexOf('tx_del_confirm:')===0);if(!ownAck)answerCb_(cbId,'',false);if(data==='noop')return;let s=getSession_(chatId);if(msgId)s.last_msg_id=msgId;try{
    if(data==='btn_menu'){s=resetSession_(chatId,true);sendOrEdit_(chatId,menuText_(),mainMenu_());return;}
    if(data==='btn_help'){const mp=getMappedPerson_(chatId);sendOrEdit_(chatId,'<b>❓ BANTUAN & PANDUAN BOT</b>\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n<b>📋 Fitur Utama:</b>\n• ➕ Catat Pemasukan, Pengeluaran, Transfer & Investasi\n• 💰 Cek Saldo per Person atau Global\n• 🔍 Filter & Cari (Tanggal / Person / Jenis / Kata Kunci)\n• ✏️ Edit & 🗑️ Hapus Transaksi dengan konfirmasi\n• 🔁 Ulangi / ↩️ batalkan transaksi terakhir (maks. 1 menit)\n• 📊 Dashboard bulanan & perbandingan bulan lalu\n• 🧠 Pencarian natural (contoh: pengeluaran Abi bulan ini makanan)\n• 📄 Export Excel / PDF\n• 🩺 Status sistem\n\n<b>⚡ Perintah Cepat:</b>\n• /start atau /menu — Menu Utama\n• /total — Cek saldo cepat\n\n<b>📌 Person Default Anda:</b> '+(mp?'<b>'+esc_(mp)+'</b>':'<i>Belum diset</i>'),[[btn_('📌 Set Person Default','prompt_set_default_person')],[btn_('◀️ Menu Utama','btn_menu')]]);return;}
    if(data==='prompt_set_default_person'){sendOrEdit_(chatId,'<b>📌 SET PERSON DEFAULT</b>\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nPilih nama Person yang mewakili Chat ID Telegram Anda.',userMapMenu_());return;}
    if(data.indexOf('set_user_map:')===0){const p=data.split(':').slice(1).join(':');if(p==='clear'){setMappedPerson_(chatId,null);sendOrEdit_(chatId,'🗑️ <b>Mapping Person Default Dihapus.</b>',[[btn_('◀️ Menu Utama','btn_menu')]]);}else{setMappedPerson_(chatId,p);sendOrEdit_(chatId,'✅ <b>Person Default Disimpan!</b>\nChat Anda → <b>'+esc_(p)+'</b>',[[btn_('◀️ Menu Utama','btn_menu')]]);}return;}
    if(data==='btn_cek_saldo'){sendOrEdit_(chatId,'<b>💰 CEK SALDO & TABUNGAN</b>\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nPilih <b>Person</b> atau <b>Semua Person</b>:',saldoPersonMenu_());return;}
    if(data.indexOf('saldo_select:')===0){showBalance_(chatId,data.substring(13));return;}
    if(data==='btn_today_summary'){executeFilter_(chatId,'date_today','',1);return;}
    if(data==='btn_recent_10'){showRecent_(chatId);return;}
    if(data==='btn_dashboard_month'){showMonthlyDashboard_(chatId);return;}
    if(data==='btn_system_status'){showSystemStatus_(chatId);return;}
    if(data==='btn_export'){sendOrEdit_(chatId,'<b>📄 EXPORT TRANSAKSI</b>\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nPilih cakupan data yang akan diekspor:',exportScopeMenu_());return;}
    if(data==='filter_prompt_natural'){s.step='WAIT_NATURAL_SEARCH';saveSession_(chatId,s);sendOrEdit_(chatId,'<b>🧠 PENCARIAN NATURAL</b>\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nKetik seperti Anda bicara biasa.\nContoh: <code>pengeluaran Abi bulan ini makanan</code>',[[btn_('◀️ Batal','btn_filter_menu')]]);return;}
    if(data.indexOf('export_scope:')===0){const type=data.substring(13),labels={today:'Hari Ini',month:'Bulan Ini',prevmonth:'Bulan Lalu',all:'Semua Data'};showExportFormat_(chatId,{type:type},labels[type]||type);return;}
    if(data==='export_scope_person'){const rows=[];let r=[];DEFAULT_PERSONS.forEach(p=>{r.push(btn_('👤 '+p,'export_person:'+p));if(r.length===2){rows.push(r);r=[];}});if(r.length)rows.push(r);rows.push([btn_('◀️ Kembali','btn_export')]);sendOrEdit_(chatId,'<b>👤 EXPORT PER PERSON</b>\nPilih Person:',rows);return;}
    if(data.indexOf('export_person:')===0){const p=data.substring(14);showExportFormat_(chatId,{type:'person',person:p},'Person '+p);return;}
